17:T955,[{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Service","name":"Tire repair in Canada","serviceType":"tire repair","provider":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Canada Tire Repair & Roadside","telephone":"+1888XXXXXXX","url":"https://canadatirerepair.com/"},"areaServed":"Canada (National)","url":"https://canadatirerepair.com/tire-repair","description":"We inspect beads, valves, and rims when a tire keeps losing pressure. We coordinate tire repair from coast to coast, pairing emergency roadside with proper tire orders. Franchise and multi-site managers use this line for tire repair—note brand standards if fleet numbering or DOT stickers matter. When tire repair spikes after holidays, early calls secure roadside slots before supplier queues grow. Related searches such as tire repair service near me are handled on the same line. Reach us at 1-888-XXX-XXXX—tell us if you need roadside tonight and permanent tire later."},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://canadatirerepair.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Services","item":"https://canadatirerepair.com/services"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Tire repair Canada","item":"https://canadatirerepair.com/tire-repair"}]},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is tire repair in Canada priced per tire or per wheel well?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Price depends on tire type, size, access, and whether roadside is needed tonight. Call 1-888-XXX-XXXX with photos for a range before we book."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How soon can you do tire repair in Canada?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Exposed wheel wells and security risks move you up the queue—say so clearly when you call 1-888-XXX-XXXX."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you work with my property manager for tire repair in Canada?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answe